---
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact Peter | HVAC Second Opinion"
  description="Contact Peter, creator of HVAC Second Opinion, via email for error corrections, source updates, or general homeowner feedback. No forms or tracking."
>
  <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Calculator</a> / <span>Contact</span>
  </nav>

  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p class="intro-lead">
      Have a question about a calculation formula, spotted an updated DOE or state rebate rule, or want to suggest a guide topic? Send an email directly—there are no contact forms or tracking pixels on this page.
    </p>

    <div class="source-callout">
      <p style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
        <strong>Direct Email (Peter, Independent Developer):</strong>
      </p>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}?subject=HVAC%20Second%20Opinion%20Feedback`}>
          {SITE.email}
        </a>
      </p>
      <p class="field-note" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
        <strong>Response time:</strong> I typically reply within 3 business days.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2>How Your Email Is Handled (Privacy &amp; Deletion)</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Used only to reply or fix errors:</strong> If you email about a calculation check, source update, or broken link, your message and email address are used solely to read and answer your inquiry.</li>
      <li><strong>Never sold, shared, or subscribed:</strong> We never sell or forward homeowner emails to HVAC contractors, lead aggregators, or marketing lists, and there is no newsletter signup.</li>
      <li><strong>Retention and deletion:</strong> Emails stay only in the mailbox while a thread is open and are routinely cleared after resolution—or deleted immediately if you ask for removal in your email.</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="field-note">
      Please note: I am an independent developer, not a licensed HVAC technician or mechanical engineer, so I cannot inspect equipment or provide binding safety or pricing diagnoses by email.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
